function cohabMemoryOpen(id,opt){const d=cohabData(id),c=getC(id);if(!d||!c)return;if(cohabMemoryEnsureIds(d))save(0);const items=(d.summaries||[]).slice().sort((a,b)=>(+b.ts||0)-(+a.ts||0)),stars=(x,key)=>{const n=Math.max(1,Math.min(5,+x.imp||3));return `<div role="group" aria-label="共同生活记忆重要度" style="display:flex;gap:2px;margin:0 0 5px">${[1,2,3,4,5].map(v=>`<button type="button" aria-label="设为${v}星" title="设为${v}星" data-cid="${esc(id)}" data-mid="${esc(key)}" onclick="cohabMemorySetImp(this.dataset.cid,this.dataset.mid,${v})" style="padding:0 1px;border:0;background:transparent;color:${v<=n?'#f5b301':'#777'};font-size:16px;line-height:1;cursor:pointer">${v<=n?'★':'☆'}</button>`).join('')}</div>`;};openModal(`<h3>共同生活记忆</h3><div class="hint" style="line-height:1.75">这里只有共同生活自己的总结，不会复制到微信记忆列表，也不会写入原来的单次线下约会。开启线上/线下同步时，微信与共同生活里的${esc(c.remark||c.name)}只会按当前话题临时读取这里的相关记忆。点星星可设 1–5 星；高星记忆会优先参与回忆，5 星不会被容量清理。</div><div class="cohab-memory-list" data-cohab-memory-list>${items.length?items.map(x=>{const key=String(x.id);return `<article data-cohab-memory-id="${esc(key)}"><div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px"><div style="flex:1;min-width:0">${stars(x,key)}<time>${esc(offDateTime(x.ts))} · ${Math.max(1,+x.rounds||1)}轮 · ${x.mode==='split'?'分段':'整段'}</time><p>${esc(x.text||'')}</p></div><button type="button" aria-label="删除共同生活记忆" data-cid="${esc(id)}" data-mid="${esc(key)}" onclick="cohabMemoryDelete(this.dataset.cid,this.dataset.mid)" style="width:34px;height:34px;flex:none;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(250,81,81,.28);background:rgba(250,81,81,.09);color:#ff7474;cursor:pointer;font-size:18px">×</button></div></article>`;}).join(''):'<div class="empty" style="padding:28px 8px">还没有生成共同生活记忆</div>'}</div>${items.length?`<div class="it" style="margin-top:10px"><span>清理低星<br><small style="color:#888">立刻清掉不重要的；5星永远保留</small></span><span class="v"><button class="minibtn" data-cid="${esc(id)}" onclick="cohabMemoryPruneLowStars(this.dataset.cid,1)">清1星</button> <button class="minibtn" data-cid="${esc(id)}" onclick="cohabMemoryPruneLowStars(this.dataset.cid,2)">清2星及以下</button> <button class="minibtn" data-cid="${esc(id)}" onclick="cohabMemoryPruneLowStars(this.dataset.cid,3)">清3星及以下</button></span></div>`:''}<div class="btns" style="margin-top:12px"><button class="btn g" onclick="closeModal()">关闭</button>${items.length?`<button class="btn d" data-cid="${esc(id)}" onclick="cohabMemoryClear(this.dataset.cid)">清空记忆</button>`:''}<button class="btn p" data-cid="${esc(id)}" onclick="closeModal();cohabSummarizeNow(this.dataset.cid)">立即总结</button></div>`);if(opt&&Number.isFinite(+opt.scrollTop))cohabMemoryRestoreScroll(opt.scrollTop);}
function cohabPushMessage(d,m){if(!d||!m)return m;d.msgSeq=Math.max(0,+d.msgSeq||0)+1;m.cohabSeq=d.msgSeq;if(!Number.isFinite(+m.time))m.time=Date.now();d.msgs.push(m);lifeNoteCommitItem(m);const root=S.cohabitation&&S.cohabitation.homes||{},id=Object.keys(root).find(k=>root[k]===d);if(id&&m.who!=='日期')roleServerPushTouchSoon(id,m.time);return m;}
function cohabPushNotice(d,text,opt){if(!d||!String(text||'').trim())return null;opt=opt||{};d.notices=Array.isArray(d.notices)?d.notices:[];const key=String(opt.key||''),old=key&&d.notices.find(x=>x&&x.key===key);if(old)return old;const item={id:uid(),kind:opt.kind||'system',key,time:Number.isFinite(+opt.time)?+opt.time:Date.now(),text:String(text).replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim().slice(0,260),tripId:String(opt.tripId||'')};d.notices.push(item);d.notices=d.notices.slice(-60);return item;}
