function cohabSummaryItems(raw,mode){if(mode==='single'){const text=trimSentence(cleanReply(raw),420);return cohabSummaryValid(text)?[{text,imp:4}]:[];}let data=null,s=String(raw||'');try{const object=s.match(/\{[\s\S]*\}/),array=s.match(/\[[\s\S]*\]/);data=JSON.parse(object?object[0]:array?array[0]:'null');}catch(_){}const list=Array.isArray(data)?data:Array.isArray(data&&data.items)?data.items:[];return list.map(x=>({text:trimSentence(cleanReply(x&&x.text||''),260),imp:Math.max(1,Math.min(5,+x.imp||+x.importance||3))})).filter(x=>cohabSummaryValid(x.text)).slice(0,8);}
